bibliograph (0.5.14) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The follow graph is indexable again. `follows` (follower_did → followed_did)
    comes back in migration 0028 as a derived read index over
    `net.olamaelcu.livtet.biblio.follow` records, which TAP already mirrors into
    `records`. The migration seeds it with one `INSERT … SELECT`, and the TAP
    upsert/delete tasks keep it in step by recomputing a pair from the mirror,
    so a delete racing an upsert cannot leave a dangling edge.
