    repo this instance never registered — from Constellation, which indexes the
    whole network. Idempotent, bounded by `--limit`, and driven by
    `bibliograph-follows-backfill.timer` every hour.
  * The Constellation `SocialSource` named `biblio.social:follow`, a collection
    that has never existed; it now names the real `biblio.follow:subject`.

