bibliograph (0.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * OpenLibrary returns as an ISBN-discovery source only. A title search
    resolves each top work's editions and pairs every edition with its own
    ISBN (work-level results aggregate all editions' ISBNs, which is the wrong
    thing to write); the existing matcher still decides.
